Z||000001||Monkeyman||07-03-2001||05:53 PM||||I'm only assuming that your from the Great White North (since there are many places in the States that sell NOS kits and you referred to "the border").  If you know anybody that lives close to the border on the States side (Buffalo or Detroit, maybe), you might have it shipped to them.  They could pack it in the trunk (please, don't get caught), drive across, then ship it from your side.  It would surely cost you more, but at least you'd get it.<P>------------------<BR>'Consciousness:  That annoying time between naps.'<P>MM||||reg||1
